    <bpmn:process id="W_W4958" name="W4958. Internal Audit, Bank Covenant Assurance &amp; Issue Remediation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Audit plan (VS-21); field exam (W4943); bank request; issue identified (W4957)
Frequency: Annual audit + event-driven
Volume: ~1 program audit per cycle + issue remediation
Owner: Internal Audit (VS-21) / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager
Participants: Internal Audit (VS-21), Finance (VS-17), Treasury (VS-18), Legal (VS-100), External Audit
Source: workflow W4958 — Internal Audit, Bank Covenant Assurance &amp; Issue Remediation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4958_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4958_Lane1" name="Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4958_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4958_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4958_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4958_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4958_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4958_Start3" name="Audit plan (VS-21); field exam (W4943); bank request; issue identified (W4957)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4958_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4958_Task4" name="Audit the collateral-financing program: test certificate accuracy (W4939)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Audit the collateral-financing program: test certificate accuracy (W4939), eligibility testing (W4940/W4941), availability controls (W4942), proceeds segregation (W4947), release authorization (W4952), covenant compliance (W4944), and disclosure (W4955); coordinate with the bank&#x27;s field-exam findings (W4943) and external audit (VS-21)
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / ABL Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4958_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4958_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4958_Task5" name="Manage issues &amp; remediation: log audit/bank findings, root-cause, assign…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage issues &amp; remediation: log audit/bank findings, root-cause, assign remediation owners/dates, track to closure, and verify effectiveness; manage any control deficiencies (VS-21 CAPA)
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / ABL Manager / Process Owners
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4958_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4958_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4958_Task6" name="Report &amp; assure: report program audit results and remediation status to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report &amp; assure: report program audit results and remediation status to the audit committee (VS-36) and management, provide bank-covenant assurance, and feed continuous improvement (W4960)
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Treasurer
Accountable (A): Audit Committee / CFO
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4958_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4958_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4958_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4958_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
