        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-742 (ensure controlled execution — Collateral Release, Reconciliation, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-170.3).) | - CTL-742: annual audit completed; issues logged &amp; remediated; CAPA tracked; bank-covenant assurance reported
Owner: Internal Audit (VS-21) / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
