    <bpmn:process id="W_W4959" name="W4959. Interest Accrual, Charge Settlement &amp; Bank Fee Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly close (VS-17.1); bank billing statement
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~1 settlement/reconciliation per facility per month × 1–3 facilities
Owner: Treasury / Finance / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17), AP (VS-15), Data (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4959 — Interest Accrual, Charge Settlement &amp; Bank Fee Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4959_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4959_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4959_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4959_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4959_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4959_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4959_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4959_Start3" name="Monthly close (VS-17.1); bank billing statement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4959_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4959_Task4" name="Accrue interest &amp; charges: accrue interest on drawn balances, commitment fee on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Accrue interest &amp; charges: accrue interest on drawn balances, commitment fee on undrawn, utilization/capitalized fees, field-exam/collateral-manager fees, and other facility charges; post to the GL (VS-17) by entity/facility
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance / AP
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4959_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4959_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4959_Task5" name="Settle &amp; reconcile bank charges: receive the bank billing statement, settle the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Settle &amp; reconcile bank charges: receive the bank billing statement, settle the charges, reconcile to the accrual, investigate variances (rate/fee/days), and correct; allocate cost across entities (VS-72)
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance / AP / Analytics
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4959_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4959_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4959_Task6" name="Validate effective rate &amp; feed analytics: confirm the settled charges reconcile…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Validate effective rate &amp; feed analytics: confirm the settled charges reconcile to the effective-rate analytics (W4956), flag cost anomalies, and report to management
Responsible (R): Treasury / FP&amp;A / Analytics
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4959_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4959_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4959_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4959_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4959_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-742 (ensure controlled execution — Collateral Release, Reconciliation, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-170.3).) | - CTL-742 (monthly accrual &amp; reconciliation; bank charges disputed on variance; effective-rate validated; cost allocated (VS-72))
Owner: Treasury / Finance / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
