    <bpmn:process id="W_W4960" name="W4960. Financing Program Continuous Improvement, Stress-Testing &amp; Strategy Feedback" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategic review (VS-33); stress event; refinance (W4937); improvement cycle
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: ~1 program-improvement cycle per year
Owner: Treasurer / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Strategy
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Finance/FP&amp;A (VS-17.4/VS-33), Supply Chain (VS-02), AR (VS-16), Data (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4960 — Financing Program Continuous Improvement, Stress-Testing &amp; Strategy Feedback</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4960_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4960_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4960_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4960_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4960_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4960_Lane2" name="Strategy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4960_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4960_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4960_Start4" name="Strategic review (VS-33); stress event; refinance (W4937); improvement cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4960_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4960_Task5" name="Stress-test the financing program: model liquidity/availability under stress…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Stress-test the financing program: model liquidity/availability under stress scenarios (import disruption VS-02.3, demand shock, AR bad-debt VS-16 W81, inventory write-down VS-05.3, rate/FX shock VS-18.3) and the covenant headroom impact (W4944)
Responsible (R): Treasury / FP&amp;A / Analytics / Strategy
Accountable (A): CFO / Treasurer
Duration: Annual + event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4960_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4960_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4960_Task6" name="Identify improvements: from analytics (W4956), audit (W4958), field exams…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify improvements: from analytics (W4956), audit (W4958), field exams (W4943), and stress tests, identify advance-rate/eligibility/process/control improvements, SCF-vs-ABL rebalancing (VS-105), and data-quality investments (VS-29)
Responsible (R): Treasury / FP&amp;A / ABL Manager / Strategy
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4960_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4960_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4960_Task7" name="Feed strategy &amp; close the loop: feed refinancing/resize/restructure strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Feed strategy &amp; close the loop: feed refinancing/resize/restructure strategy (W4937), the funding plan (VS-18.2), the capital-structure plan (VS-33), and the board finance committee (VS-36); track improvement outcomes
Responsible (R): Strategy / Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4960_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4960_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4960_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4960_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4960_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-742 (ensure controlled execution — Collateral Release, Reconciliation, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-170.3).) | - CTL-742 (annual stress-test; improvement actions tracked; strategy aligned to growth; reported to board (VS-36))
Owner: Treasurer / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Strategy</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
